PewterCity_House1_Text_Nidoran::
    .string "NIDORAN♂: Bowbow!$"

PewterCity_House1_Text_NidoranSit::
    .string "NIDORAN, sit!$"

PewterCity_House1_Text_TradeMonsAreFinicky::
    .string "Our POKéMON's an outsider, so it's\n"
    .string "finicky and hard to handle.\p"
    .string "An outsider is a POKéMON that you\n"
    .string "get in a trade.\p"
    .string "It grows fast, but it may ignore an\n"
    .string "unskilled TRAINER in battle.\p"
    .string "If only we had some BADGES…$"


PewterCity_House1_Text_ManAsk::
    .string "My NIDORAN got stung by a bug in\n"
    .string "the forest. Poisoned, poor thing.\p"
    .string "I need two ANTIDOTES. If you ever\n"
    .string "have spare ones, think of me.$"

PewterCity_House1_Text_ManOffer::
    .string "Is that ANTIDOTE I see? Could you\n"
    .string "spare two for my NIDORAN?$"

PewterCity_House1_Text_ManGives::
    .string "Bless you! Look, he is already\n"
    .string "eating again.\p"
    .string "Take this. It was in my family a\n"
    .string "long time.$"

PewterCity_House1_Text_ManSad::
    .string "I understand. Everyone needs their\n"
    .string "own supplies out there.$"
